    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math intuitive and practical, especially in economics and daily problem-solving. It’s not abstract to me—it’s about real-world patterns and logic. I enjoy how it connects to my hobbies like gardening (measuring growth) and football (statistics). Math feels like a tool for understanding the world, not a chore.",
